gh cost reduction, strengthening the leadership position that we have in the markets that we are in; and second, increasing distributions to shareholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/02/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q1-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q1","e":"bbva","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Onur Genc","x":"On the first one, on the cost restructuring in Spain -- Adrian, thank you for the questions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/02/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q1-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q1","e":"bbva","d":"2021-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jaime Saenz de Tejada","x":"For '21, we maintain our guidance of mid-single-digit growth in NII, supported by both activity in retail segments and customer spreads, which will evolve positively and will become -- will be above 2020 levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/02/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q1-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q1","e":"bbva","d":"2021-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jaime Saenz de Tejada","x":"Having said so, for '21, we maintain our guidance and expect cost of risk to be around 180 basis points, but now, again, with a clearly positive bias.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/02/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q1-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q2","e":"bbva","d":"2021-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Francisco Riquel","x":"If you can update guidance for the group and the main units and explain where the growth comes from because if you are raising tariffs, if it is because of external factors, the markets or the macro helping, or if you are really improving gross-earning ratios in any geography?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q2-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q2","e":"bbva","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Onur Genc","x":"And the one-off from the restructuring costs of the collective layoff process in Spain, including all these concepts, the final reported profits amount to EUR 701 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q2-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q2","e":"bbva","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Onur Genc","x":"The graph on the right-hand side of the slide shows our capital position with the CET1 up to 14.17% now, including the impact from the U.S. sales and also including the restructuring process in Spain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q2-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q2","e":"bbva","d":"2021-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jaime Saenz de Tejada","x":"So we are maintaining our guidance of broadly flat.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q2-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q2","e":"bbva","d":"2021-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jaime Saenz de Tejada","x":"That's why we are reiterating the guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q2-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q3","e":"bbva","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Onur Genc","x":"Let me note here on this page that for comparison purposes, all these figures exclude nonrecurring impacts as the sale of the U.S. business or the PNC or the restructuring program in Spain, impacts, which affect the baseline, which affect previous quarters, obviously, no impact in this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/30/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q3-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q3","e":"bbva","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Onur Genc","x":"And more importantly, most of the cost savings that we will be generating out of the area that we have done in the second quarter, it's going to be arriving in 2022 and more in the fourth quarter in 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/30/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q3-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q4","e":"bbva","d":"2022-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Onur Genc","x":"The total amount to be distributed, it corresponds to a payout of 44% of the net attributable profit, including the BBVA U.S.A. results and the net impact from the restructuring process in Spain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q4-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2021 Q4","e":"bbva","d":"2022-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rafa Salinas","x":"The fact is that, as you mentioned, clearly, the restructuring program is going to provide a saving of EUR 225 million on a 12-month basis in Spain and an additional EUR 25 million at the corporate centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q4-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2022 Q1","e":"bbva","d":"2022-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Sofie Peterzens","x":"I was just wondering if you could kind of talk a little bit about the NII or the assumptions that you have in your new rate sensitivity guidance for Spain, 15% to 20%, what kind of deposit data and pass-through have you assumed here?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/01/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q1-2022-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2022 Q1","e":"bbva","d":"2022-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Onur Genc","x":"2021, first half, in terms of comparison, it excludes nonrecurring impacts, more specifically, the U.S. business sold to PNC, and also the restructuring program in Spain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/01/banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-bbva-q1-2022-earni/"},{"c":"BBVA 2022 Q1","e":"bbva","d":"2022-04-29","